---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Farm | Hello Honey Bunny Goat Dairy Near Pune"
  description="Meet Hello Honey Bunny, a small goat dairy farm near Pune built around animal wellbeing, clean handling, local freshness and patient craft."
  canonicalPath="/about.html"
  activePage="about"
  image="/assets/images/editorial/goat-portrait.webp"
>
  <main id="main">
<section class="page-hero page-hero-farm"><div class="container page-hero-grid">
      <div class="page-hero-copy" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">Our farm</p><h1>Care is the first ingredient.</h1><p class="lede">Hello Honey Bunny began with a simple conviction: serious farming can still feel personal. We are building a focused goat dairy near Pune where responsible care and clean craft set the pace.</p></div>
      <div class="page-hero-visual photo-stage" data-motion-scene data-reveal="right">
        <div class="visual-frame" data-depth-layer="1"><img src="/assets/images/editorial/farm-morning.webp" alt="Goats beside their timber shelter in the soft Pune morning light" width="1586" height="992"></div>
        <span class="visual-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="visual-chip visual-chip-top" data-depth-layer="3">Near Pune · Est. 2026</span>
        <aside class="page-hero-note visual-note" data-depth-layer="2"><strong>One farm. One clear standard.</strong>Learning the land, establishing routines and growing deliberately.</aside>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section"><div class="container story-grid">
      <div class="story-media landscape" data-reveal="left"><img src="/assets/images/editorial/farm-morning.webp" alt="Goats beside a clean timber shelter in morning light near Pune" width="1586" height="992"></div>
      <div class="story-copy" data-reveal="right"><p class="eyebrow">Our philosophy</p><h2>Small enough to notice.</h2><p class="large-copy">A healthy farm is made from a thousand quiet decisions, repeated with care.</p><p>We want to know the animals, understand the daily rhythm and be close enough to the work that details never disappear into scale. That means starting small, growing responsibly and being honest about what is available.</p><p>The name may smile, but the work is thoughtful: sensible shelters, attentive husbandry, clean handling and patient product development.</p></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section section-cream"><div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading center" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">The standard we are setting</p><h2>Simple principles. Daily practice.</h2><p>These are not marketing badges. They are the operating choices we intend to make visible as the farm grows.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-grid stagger">
        <article class="feature" data-reveal><span class="feature-number">01</span><h3>Animal wellbeing</h3><p>Calm handling, suitable shelter and attentive daily observation.</p></article>
        <article class="feature" data-reveal><span class="feature-number">02</span><h3>Clean process</h3><p>Clear hygiene routines and careful temperature management.</p></article>
        <article class="feature" data-reveal><span class="feature-number">03</span><h3>Thoughtful sourcing</h3><p>Practical, responsible choices shaped by the farm and its region.</p></article>
        <article class="feature" data-reveal><span class="feature-number">04</span><h3>Honest availability</h3><p>Seasonal and limited products are labelled exactly as they are.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section"><div class="container story-grid reverse">
      <div class="story-media portrait" data-reveal="right"><img src="/assets/images/editorial/goat-portrait.webp" alt="Young goat calmly standing among grasses at the farm" loading="lazy" width="1122" height="1402"></div>
      <div class="story-copy" data-reveal="left"><p class="eyebrow">A better daily ritual</p><h2>Closer food feels different.</h2><p class="large-copy">Not because it needs a grand story—because the journey is shorter and the hands behind it are visible.</p><p>Our aim is to make goat dairy feel approachable, useful and beautifully ordinary: milk for the breakfast table, paneer for dinner, curd for the everyday bowl and cheese worth lingering over.</p><p>We make no exaggerated health promises. Goat milk is still dairy and individual needs differ. What we can promise is clarity about our products, careful handling and a human conversation when you order.</p></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section section-forest"><div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading split" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">From farm to family</p><h2>Made slowly. Served fresh.</h2></div><p class="text-on-dark">Our first chapter is local. Shorter journeys give fresh products a gentler route from the farm to your table.</p></div>
      <div class="steps stagger">
        <div class="step" data-reveal><span>Morning</span><h3>Observe first</h3><p>The day begins with the animals and the condition of the farm.</p></div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal><span>Prepare</span><h3>Work cleanly</h3><p>Small quantities allow a close eye on handling and consistency.</p></div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal><span>Hold</span><h3>Keep it cool</h3><p>Cold handling and clear storage guidance protect freshness.</p></div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal><span>Share</span><h3>Confirm locally</h3><p>Every early order is checked personally before it leaves us.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section"><div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading split" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">Founding season</p><h2>Growing at the speed of trust.</h2></div><p>We are establishing the farm now, with limited releases rather than pretending the full range is already on the shelf.</p></div>
      <div class="stat-grid stagger">
        <div class="stat" data-reveal><strong>01</strong><span>One focused farm near Pune.</span></div>
        <div class="stat" data-reveal><strong>Small</strong><span>Batch sizes designed around attention.</span></div>
        <div class="stat" data-reveal><strong>Local</strong><span>Orders confirmed person to person.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section section-sm"><div class="container"><div class="cta-band" data-reveal><div class="cta-band-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Come closer</p><h2>Follow the farm as it takes shape.</h2><p>See the morning work, meet the herd and ask us about future farm visits.</p></div><a class="button button-light" href="/contact.html#visit">Visit the farm</a></div></div></div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
